            "created_at": "2025-09-13T00:54:05.588581+00:00",
            "notes": "# Power & Items\n\n**[Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212)**:\n- Adds +1 additional torpedo charge will allow you to peel better and earn credits easier\n- Your bread and butter in this Season, unless you want to play healbot with [MediMaster](item_a04e1041-01c1-46ed-801e-d0590003e9b6), refer to a different guide.\n\n**[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)**:\n- Increases both damage AND healing through primary fire\n- you won't be able to sustain your tank during full focus, but should only care about keeping your tank alive enough to farm credits and relieving the critically low health status.\n\n**[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)**:\n- Boosts torpedo damage, along with [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) it becomes your bread and butter to execute low HP enemies\n\n**[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)**: \n- 25 armor for survivability during aggressive positioning\n- Ashe among other counters are picked almost every game, this will keep you somewhat alive\n\n---\n\n## Round 1 Playstyle\n\n**Avoid Dying**: \n- Can't farm when you are dead\n- Position as far back as possible without losing the ability to heal and torpedo\n- Even if your whole team dies, escape with Hyper Ring if it's up\n\n**Farm Aggressively**: \n- Pocket your tank and take **aggressive angles for torpedoes when the enemy team is distracted**\n- Use the tank as your anchor point while staying far back\n- Use torpedoes to heal critically low allies\n\n**Positioning**:\n- **Narrow spaces**: Torpedo your allies when critically low\n- **Wide spaces**: Take risky positions for good torpedo shots on allied and enemy teams for credits, the more you hit, the higher the chance of getting assists for healing or damage. \n\n**Priority**: Stay Alive > Heal Tank > Kill and Assist off cooldown",
