            "notes": "# Items\n\n**[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)**:\n- Amazing value\n- Stacks instantly, gives you flat WP for better farming and increased incoming damage for round 2 and free AP for your torpedoes, along with a bit of sustain. I feel that you are always short on a tiny bit of health when escaping, this should help as well.\n\n\n**[Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7)** (optional): \n- Gives you cheap sustain\n\n**[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)** (optional): \n- Shoot faster = faster healing + faster damage\n\n---\n\n## Round 2 Playstyle\n\nSame as Round 1",
