            "notes": "# Power & Items\n\n**[Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca)**:\n- Still strong after the nerfs\n- Counters Cybervenom and anti heal\n\n\n**[PulStar Destroyers](item_707ad8c7-a153-4140-b4bc-1f23f7d7a648)**:\n- Gives you a lot value for little credits, you can pressure the enemy team and execute to stay afloat economy wise.\n- Replace [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) with this. [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) is not as strong in round 3, focus on [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) for more value [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) and [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca)\n\n**[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)**:\n- Huge Ability Power boost\n- Prioritize this over other items without selling\n\n**[Lux Loop](item_afa69bd2-683f-486d-bc1e-e40d49281679)**:\n- Great for teammates who don't know how to touch your hyper ring (low elo)\n- Makes hyper ring last longer (indirect cooldown reduction)\n- Gets more value with powers and additional AP\n\n\n**[Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214)**:\n- Insane value\n- Replace [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with this\n \nSell the green items if you can get all of the listen ones.\n---\n\n## Round 3 Playstyle\n\nIf you are not used to play hyper ring, this will feel weird. Actively think about how you position your ring. If you have a Rein or Dva. position the Hyper Ring infront of team, instead on them, so they get the benefits when they dive. Try to use your rings during fights, escapes and dives, on as many people as possible. A well positioned and timed ring can influence a fight heavily. Dont aim your ring only on the ground, move it up a little for a bit more range and usability for airborne allies. All further powers will only enchant your hyper ring more. \n\nIf your ring is utilized properly by you and your allies, you can replace lux loop with something else, I would strongly recommend to keep it in low elo (not stadium rank, your actual rank)\n\nYou are no longer a healbot, you can take even more aggressive angles to get massive torpedoes, less healing, more dealing, do not let your allies die when possible, they are your only form of income. You cant go flanking solo like with blink boosters before the nerf.",
